# No production Caddy configuration is currently shipped.
#
# The old cloud-router example does not apply to the local Docker runtime.
#
# Task 4 must implement and document all of the following before this becomes a
# real example:
#
# 1. serve the embedded panel and API from the snaphost process;
# 2. serve generated DOMAIN_SUFFIX hosts by resolving their running Docker
#    containers;
# 3. authorize on-demand certificates only for verified custom_domains rows;
# 4. route a verified custom hostname to its alias target;
# 5. define a narrow edge-to-application authorization contract without
#    exposing a general service-to-service API.
#
# See docs/operations/custom-domains.md and
# docs/decisions/0007-custom-domain-tls-edge.md.
#
# This comments-only file is intentionally not installable.
